              "name": "Joe Sawler"
            },
            "reviewBody": "very simple, very delicious! I added 1 cup sour cream and turned it into a great chip dip!!",
            "datePublished": "2020-12-22T22:09:56.497Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "amanda"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I changed the recipe slightly since I am diabetic. I used 1 cup of reduced sugar ketchup, 1/3 cup horseradish and 1/4 teaspoon of lemon juice. I completely omitted the brown sugar. Very tasty!!",
            "datePublished": "2017-12-25T16:35:44.263Z"
          },
          {
